---
title: "GET handler (stem-system auth/callback/route.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_origin: resolve origin from request headers
    q_origin --> q_redirect_target: resolve redirect target from cookies and params
    q_redirect_target --> q_log_debug: console.log debug info
    q_log_debug --> q_check_code: code !== null

    q_check_code --> q_init_supabase: code present
    q_check_code --> q_no_code: code is null

    q_init_supabase --> q_exchange: exchangeCodeForSession(code)
    q_exchange --> q_check_result: check error

    q_check_result --> q_success_redirect: no error
    q_check_result --> q_error_redirect: error

    q_success_redirect --> q_set_cookies: set session cookies + clear oauth cookies
    q_set_cookies --> [*]: return redirect(redirectUrl, 303)

    q_error_redirect --> [*]: return redirect(/login?error=message)

    q_no_code --> [*]: return redirect(/login?error=Could not authenticate user)

    note right of q_check_code
        INV-001: all paths terminate with an HTTP redirect response (no unhandled cases)
        INV-002: debug logging exposes partial cookie values and presence flags
        INV-003: environment variables SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_ANON_KEY must be defined (non-null assertion)
    end note
